Package: dcomp
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         docker.io (>= 25.0)
Description: Docker component lifecycle manager for Cyclo
 DComp applies declarative component systems to a local Docker Engine. It owns
 container, network, volume, and interrupted-operation lifecycle while Cyclo
 owns project and team intent.
 .
 This package installs the dcomp and dcomp-healthcheck commands only. It does
 not start a service, create a system user, or create Docker resources.
